    "slides": [
      {
        "title": "From World War I to World War II",
        "img": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Cheshire_Regiment_trench_Somme_1916.jpg",
        "cap": "Historical connection: Unresolved postwar settlement",
        "body": "World War II grew from the unstable peace that followed World War I. The Treaty of Versailles, economic crisis, wounded nationalism, and the failure of collective security gave revisionist powers room to overturn the postwar order. Germany's invasion of Poland transformed those unresolved tensions into another global war.",
