        "title": "Rattenkrieg",
        "body": "The Germans called it Rattenkrieg — Rat War. Soviet defenders contested every building, every floor, every room. Pavlov's House was held by a single platoon for 60 days — longer than it took Germany to conquer France. Snipers stalked through rubble and sewers.",
        "img": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Stalingrad_-_ruined_city.jpg/960px-Stalingrad_-_ruined_city.jpg",
